OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies 'heartbroken' as grave
OL,4,Adecorations binned
OL,5,
OL,6,FPocklington Group of Churches said it
OL,7,Fwas "deeply sorry" and though they had
OL,8,Ftried to apply churchyard regulations,
OL,9,F"we accept the way this was carried out
OL,10,Fcaused considerable hurt".
